<title>USA: Pleasant Valley CSD, Iowa won by Robert W. Baird.</title>
<headline>Pleasant Valley CSD, Iowa won by Robert W. Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert W. Baird &amp; Co., Inc. said it won $4.86 million of Pleasant Valley Community Sch Dist, Iowa, refunding school general obligationbonds, with a net interest cost of 4.55 percent.</p>
